# What gets installed into ~/.bashy, for rsync --include-from.
#
# This is an allow list: the last line excludes everything, so anything not named
# here stays out. That way a new file at the top of the repo is not silently
# deployed, which is what kept happening with the old .excludes list.
#
# Directories need the trailing /*** to pull in their contents too.
bashy.sh
bashy.list
core/***
plugins/***
- *
